@0    = ~Here you are. I’ll be going back to the Gate, but I’ll return to get you in a few days.~
@1    = ~By Helm! This island has an overwhelming sense of evil about it. We must stay vigilant!~
@2    = ~There is something not quite right about the nature here. I cannot place it exactly, but something is off.~
@3    = ~Do you sense that? Something lurks in the woods here.~
@4    = ~I believe everyone else is in that Dining Hall there. Enjoy your stay!~
